'''Potion''' is an [[Uncommon Weapons|uncommon]] knife that was originally obtainable by purchasing the 14th tier in the Main Event during the [[Halloween Event 2018|2018 Halloween Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.

==Appearance==
Its blade represents the look of a dark purple potion, hence the name. The guard is a magenta and the handle is a solid black.

==Trivia== 
*It has a [[Potion Gun (2018)|partner gun]] under the same name, making the [https://murder-mystery-2.fandom.com/wiki/Murder_Mystery_2_Wiki:Wiki-Bot/Potion_Set Potion Set].

